  {
   "id": "mYSMVG9XBwAJ",
   "from": "Nick Matzke",
   "author": "115d05260b0c341a",
   "date": "2017-08-19T06:08:08Z",
   "subject": "Re: [BioGeoBEARS] Error in BSM",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Hi -- sent this before but from wrong email. I am now traveling for a week + and may be scarce. Cheers, Nick</span><div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Hi --  it means what it says...those two things are not the same length for some reason!  Probably it is something about having accidentally or intentionally changed the include_null_range setting, the list of states, etc.</span><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Look carefully at this part of the script:</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><a href=\"http://phylo.wikidot.com/biogeographical-stochastic-mapping-example-script#BSM_script\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://phylo.wikidot.com/biogeographical-stochastic-mapping-example-script%23BSM_script&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484803705000&amp;usg=AOvVaw28aX9DacOs0J-vyVa1NEQn\">http://phylo.wikidot.com/biogeographical-stochastic-mapping-example-script#BSM_script</a><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">colors_list_for_states = get_colors_for_states_list_0based(areanames=areanames, states_list_0based=states_list_0based, max_range_size=max_range_size, plot_null_range=TRUE)</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Use the length() function to determine the length of:</span><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">&quot;colors_list_for_states&quot; - the list of colors for each state (a state is a geographic range)</span><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">&quot;</span>states_list_0based<span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">&quot; - the actual list of states (where each state has 0 or more areas)</span></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">See also:</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!search/possible_ranges_list_txt$20colors_list_for_states/biogeobears/zkHP_YpA9kY/KKpxrdp8tC0J\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!search/possible_ranges_list_txt$20colors_list_for_states/biogeobears/zkHP_YpA9kY/KKpxrdp8tC0J&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484803705000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3j5n7dOOW5OYYy1I1WNcEK\">https://groups.google.com/forum/#!search/possible_ranges_list_txt$20colors_list_for_states/<span>biogeobears</span>/zkHP_YpA9kY/KKpxrdp8tC0J</a><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Make sure you are using the script at <a href=\"http://phylo.wikidot.com/biogeographical-stochastic-mapping-example-script#BSM_script\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://phylo.wikidot.com/biogeographical-stochastic-mapping-example-script%23BSM_script&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484803705000&amp;usg=AOvVaw28aX9DacOs0J-vyVa1NEQn\">http://phylo.wikidot.com/biogeographical-stochastic-mapping-example-script#BSM_script</a> and not some older one, make sure you&#39;re using the latest source() commands, make sure you&#39;re running the script from the top and not skipping or repeating lines through sloppy copy/paste, etc.</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">If you can&#39;t figure it out, email me everything, but I am traveling soon so this could take awhile.</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Cheers!</div></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
