, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&#39;Form is a moving, a becoming, a passing thing. The doctrine of forms is the doctrine of transformation. The doctrine of metamorphosis is the key to all signs of nature&#39; J.W. von Goethe<br></font><br><br></div></font></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n<br></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2017-08-19 8:08 GMT+02:00 Nick Matzke <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">nickmat...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span>:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Hi -- sent this before but from wrong email. I am now traveling for a week + and may be scarce. Cheers, Nick</span><div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Hi --  it means what it says...those two things are not the same length for some reason!  Probably it is something about having accidentally or intentionally changed the include_null_range setting, the list of states, etc.</span><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Look carefully at this part of the script:</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><a href=\"http://phylo.wikidot.com/biogeographical-stochastic-mapping-example-script#BSM_script\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://phylo.wikidot.com/biogeographical-stochastic-mapping-example-script%23BSM_script&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484803709000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1bdNicbDhfTQnLh4WTpwhC\">http://phylo.wikidot.com/biogeographical-stochastic-mapping-example-script#BSM_script</a><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">colors_list_for_states = get_colors_for_states_list_0based(areanames=areanames, states_list_0based=states_list_0based, max_range_size=max_range_size, plot_null_range=TRUE)</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Use the length() function to determine the length of:</span><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">&quot;colors_list_for_states&quot; - the list of colors for each state (a state is a geographic range)</span><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">&quot;</span>states_list_0based<span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">&quot; - the actual list of states (where each state has 0 or more areas)</span></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">See also:</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!search/possible_ranges_list_txt$20colors_list_for_states/biogeobears/zkHP_YpA9kY/KKpxrdp8tC0J\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!search/possible_ranges_list_txt$20colors_list_for_states/biogeobears/zkHP_YpA9kY/KKpxrdp8tC0J&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484803710000&amp;usg=AOvVaw118a3vNqHvTK9SLf85NHSZ\">https://groups.google.com/forum/#!search/possible_ranges_list_txt$20colors_list_for_states/<span>biogeobears</span>/zkHP_YpA9kY/KKpxrdp8tC0J</a><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Make sure you are using the script at <a href=\"http://phylo.wikidot.com/biogeographical-stochastic-mapping-example-script#BSM_script\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://phylo.wikidot.com/biogeographical-stochastic-mapping-example-script%23BSM_script&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484803710000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2fNjwhZFyoUR15A5A-cEzT\">http://phylo.wikidot.com/biogeographical-stochastic-mapping-example-script#BSM_script</a> and not some older one, make sure you&#39;re using the latest source() commands, make sure you&#39;re running the script from the top and not skipping or repeating lines through sloppy copy/paste, etc.</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">If you can&#39;t figure it out, email me everything, but I am traveling soon so this could take awhile.</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Cheers!</div></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div><div>On Tue, Aug 15, 2017 at 4:02 PM, Gabriel Ferreira <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">gsferr...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Hi,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">I am trying to run BSM on my data with a DEC+x+j model and it worked well until the final PDF. When I run the plot_BioGeoBEARS_results() function it returns the following error:</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><div class=\"gmail_default\"> Error in rangestxt_to_colors(possible_ranges_list_txt, colors_list_for_states,  : </div><div class=\"gmail_default\">  Error: possible_ranges_list_txt and colors_list_for_states must be the same length </div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\">Does anyone know what that means?</div><div class=\"gmail_default\">Thanks in advance.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\">Cheers,</div></div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-family:garamond,serif;font-size:large\"><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">-----------------------------------------------------------------</span></div><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><b>Gabriel S. Ferreira</b> - </font><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">PhD Student</span><br></div><div><font size=\"2\"><div style=\"text-align:center\"><div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Phone: <a href=\"tel:+55%2016%203315-4984\" value=\"+551633154984\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+55-16-3315 4984</a></span><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"http://sites.ffclrp.usp.br/paleo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://sites.ffclrp.usp.br/paleo/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484803710000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3qERCy8QTKYXTcAruvoaWc\">PaleoLab</a>, Uni. São Paulo, </font><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Ribeirão Preto, </span><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Brazil</span></div></div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Eberhard Karls Universität </font><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Tübingen/Germany</span><br></div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">-----------------------------------------------------------------</font></div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&#39;Form is a moving, a becoming, a passing thing. The doctrine of forms is the doctrine of transformation. The doctrine of metamorphosis is the key to all signs of nature&#39; J.W. von Goethe<span><font color=\"#888888\"><br></font></span></font><span><font color=\"#888888\"><br><br></font></span></div></font></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n</font></span></div></div></div><span><font color=\"#888888\"><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;BioGeoBEARS&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">biogeobears+unsubscribe@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">bioge...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nVisit this group at <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/group/biogeobears\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/group/biogeobears&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484803710000&amp;usg=AOvVaw03J8ooC3L6bfIpVPPjIpdL\">https://groups.google.com/group/biogeobears</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/biogeobears/CACH9tp7XztKB4Q2SBxdJhCQu_rt_1%2BUBGbCOJgg1rVo3M14Aeg%40mail.gmail.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/biogeobears/CACH9tp7XztKB4Q2SBxdJhCQu_rt_1%252BUBGbCOJgg1rVo3M14Aeg%2540mail.gmail.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484803710000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1hFUCZQkotHgCzD_yFQ7G9\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/biogeobears/CACH9tp7XztKB4Q2SBxdJhCQu_rt_1%2BUBGbCOJgg1rVo3M14Aeg%40mail.gmail.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;us